      "description": {
        "fun": "Two tiny mice that stick together no matter what. They split any food they find exactly in half and eat it together, and work as a team to gnaw off bits of anything that might make a good nest and carry them home. How they become a bigger family when they evolve is a mystery: the little ones just seem to appear out of nowhere.",
